OL,3,GNEWSAInjured veteran's battle to find
OL,4,Asuitable housing
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn RAF veteran who uses a wheelchair
OL,7,Fsays he is "still fighting" after five
OL,8,Fyears to find a suitable home for
OL,9,Fhimself and his family.
OL,11,FStuart Bunyan, 47, a father-of-two, was
OL,12,Fleft unable to walk after an accident
OL,13,Fat work.
OL,15,FAfter living in temporary
OL,16,Faccommodation, Bunyan was offered a
OL,17,Ftwo-storey house in Nettleham by West
OL,18,FLindsey District Council, but he said
OL,19,Fhe has "repeatedly explained the
OL,20,Fdifficulties" of the situation,
OL,21,Fincluding not being able to get
OL,22,Fupstairs to tend to his children.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
